---
---

<header class="hero wrap" data-motion="hero">
  <h1 class="title" data-motion="title">오늘 밤<br /><em>뭐</em> 할래<span class="off">?</span></h1>
  <p class="lede" data-motion="lede">
    뭐 할지 고민하는 시간, 이제 <b>메뉴판 보듯</b> 1분이면 끝.
  </p>
  <a class="cue" href="#menu">
    오늘의 메뉴
    <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
  </a>
</header>
<hr class="rule-thick" />

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 88vh;
    display: grid;
    align-content: end;
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-4xl);
  }
  .title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-shadow:
      0 0 6px var(--color-glow-strong),
      0 0 22px var(--color-glow),
      0 0 70px var(--color-glow-wide),
      0 0 140px var(--color-glow-far);
    animation: flick 3.2s var(--ease-in-out) 1;
  }
  .title em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--color-ink-glow);
  }
  .title .off {
    color: var(--color-accent-dim);
    text-shadow: none;
    animation: buzz 6s steps(2) infinite;
  }
  /* JS 점등 연출이 붙으면 CSS 깜빡임은 끈다 */
  .title.is-js {
    animation: none;
  }
  .title :global(.ch) {
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .lede {
    max-width: 34ch;
    margin: var(--space-xl) 0 0;
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-ink-2);
  }
  .lede b {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* 스크롤 유도 */
  .cue {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-ink-3);
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .cue:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .cue svg {
    animation: bob 1.8s var(--ease-in-out) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes bob {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(4px); }
  }

  .rule-thick {
    border: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--color-glow);
    margin: 0;
  }
  @keyframes flick {
    0%, 18%, 22%, 25%, 53%, 57%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
    20%, 24%, 55% { opacity: 0.45; }
  }
  @keyframes buzz {
    0%, 92% { opacity: 1; }
    94%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      min-height: 72vh;
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .title,
    .title .off,
    .cue svg {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
</style>
